A 4133 @ Undercity, 50.1, 68.0 | Apothecary Zinge in the Apothecarium. It sends you to Vivian Lagrave in Kargath. Needs level 50.
>T 4133 @ Badlands, 2.9, 47.8
>A 4134 @ Badlands, 2.9, 47.8 | The Lost Thunderbrew Recipe drops from Hurley Blackbreath in the Grim Guzzler bar.
A 4324 @ Tanaris, 67.0, 24.0 | Yorba Screwspigot in Steamwheedle Port. It sends you to Yuka in the Burning Steppes.
>T 4324 @ Burning Steppes, 66.1, 21.9
>A 4136 @ Burning Steppes, 66.1, 21.9 | Ribbly Screwspigot is in the Grim Guzzler bar.
A 4123 @ Burning Steppes, 65.2, 23.9 | Maxwort Uberglint at Flame Crest. The Heart of the Mountain is in the vault. Needs level 50.
A 4081 @ Badlands, 3.7, 47.4 | The WANTED poster in Kargath. Kill 15 Anvilrage Guardsmen, 10 Wardens and 5 Footmen in the first part of the dungeon.
A 7201 @ Badlands, 2.9, 47.8 | Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath. 10 Essence of the Elements from the golems and elementals inside.
RUN | Blackrock Depths is inside Blackrock Mountain, between the Searing Gorge and the Burning Steppes: go in, take the chain down to the lowest ring and follow the tunnel to the portal. It is long; most groups do it in parts.
